  message: "2026-10-26: WI-rilof landed (PR #1877, dev 091984531e). On the repro fixtures the js_module stand-in package node (javascript:npm:0-0:@ws/b:package) is no longer minted, the helper/module call stubs for the sibling are gone, and the Cargo use stub resolves to crate-b/src/lib.rs. One stub remains: javascript:@ws/b:0-0:module:external_symbol, from the analyzer's raw import edge that js_module never retires (also present for every relative import) -- filed as WI-vadup. What remains for this item: the dependency-declaration tier (python tier 2, npm/cargo tier 3), plus WI-vadup's stub if this item's property test counts it."  # 28e6
